{"unit_id":"Dacangshu987__dsh-hds-interlude#card-zh","repo":"Dacangshu987/dsh-hds-interlude","commit":"ff8a33ea9a0735fb19ce1487e1068cf779627fca","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hds-interlude 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的持续叙事与幕间生活插件。它接入 agent、提示词、工具、命令、设置和 Web 服务，在会话间记录角色状态，并依据时区与经过时间补写角色生活。功能包括延迟意图与长期记忆、近期日程和主动推进、QQ 消息收发与绑定，以及浏览器设置面板。适合希望角色保持连续生活并通过 QQ 对话的用户。天气查询和分享同步功能启用时会连接相应外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:133-154","lib/qq-im/channel.js:26-46","lib/weather.js:31-45"]}
{"unit_id":"Dacangshu987__dsh-hds-interlude#card-en","repo":"Dacangshu987/dsh-hds-interlude","commit":"ff8a33ea9a0735fb19ce1487e1068cf779627fca","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hds-interlude adds persistent stories to DSH web. It stores character state across sessions and advances life by elapsed time and timezone. Features include long-term memory, scheduled follow-ups, QQ messaging, and a browser settings panel. Weather lookup and sharing use external services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:133-154","lib/qq-im/channel.js:26-46","lib/weather.js:31-45"]}
